Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.92,0:00:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Long ago, Gold Roger,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.96,0:00:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,the King of Pirates, obtained\Neverything the world had to offer,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.56,0:00:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and his dying roads drove\Ncountless souls to the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.40,0:00:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You want my treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I left everything in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.22,0:00:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, thus, a new age began.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.16,0:00:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.34,0:00:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm done playing\Nthrough with the waiting?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.56,0:00:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, I'm feeling alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.48,0:00:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out below!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.68,0:00:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.96,0:00:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise your flag up high!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.48,0:00:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail a brand new dawn!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.50,0:00:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Blaze across the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.92,0:00:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to journey on!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,On your mark!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come aboard with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.26,0:00:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on Earth, a legendary! Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.10,0:00:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can show your Haki!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.08,0:00:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'll make some waves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.00,0:01:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all not daunted!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.46,0:01:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't no beginners!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.72,0:01:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause if you're wanted!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.08,0:01:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you're a winner!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.44,0:01:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,For we are on the cruise!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.98,0:01:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And freedom is the only rule!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.74,0:01:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Fearless night and day!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.38,0:01:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause that's just our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.86,0:01:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Find one piece!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.26,0:01:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be the first!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.64,0:01:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll put it be so bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.88,0:01:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I could burst!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.79,0:01:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all this real!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.24,0:01:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be cause my hand's on the wheel!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.98,0:01:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing, filled with the waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.50,0:01:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,In a world I'm feeling\Nalive, but I'll be loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.74,0:01:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.64,0:01:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We have come so far!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.52,0:01:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta make it to the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.94,0:01:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever danger we find,\Nno one ever left behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always got your back, my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.78,0:01:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sail on shoreward, keep marching forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.54,0:01:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming from the very\Nfirst day, I'd make my name!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.14,0:02:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't you know that\Ndream hasn't changed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.92,0:02:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing through,\Nit's a wave in the air!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.98,0:02:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The world I'm feeling\Nalive, look out below!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.60,0:02:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.64,0:02:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.80,0:02:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.34,0:02:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.22,0:02:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, it's too hard to dig here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.62,0:02:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.80,0:02:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This island is all rocks and tree roots!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.32,0:02:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't bury us!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.00,0:02:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We're victims too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.10,0:02:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, I'll do anything you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.96,0:02:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let me live!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.10,0:02:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.01,0:02:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I mean Black!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.14,0:02:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He made us do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.98,0:02:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, I have a secret to share with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.30,0:02:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't give a damn about going to\Nthe new world with the Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.60,0:03:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The reason we joined!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.76,0:03:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Was so we could stab them\Nin the back and collect
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.74,0:03:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,their bounties without them\Never suspecting a thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.88,0:03:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Drift! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.42,0:03:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what that goofy stuff is,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.38,0:03:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,but you're gonna kill\Nhim if you keep that up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.48,0:03:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I will let my friend die!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.56,0:03:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.04,0:03:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.58,0:03:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.70,0:03:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,your Straw Hat did look a little off,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.84,0:03:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,but it had been two years,\Nso I didn't think much of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.44,0:03:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You lied without remorse,\Nand deception is a sin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.14,0:03:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,One that you will be buried for.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.28,0:03:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, how goes the grave?\NI'm digging! I'm digging!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.46,0:03:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sinners all, these poor fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.76,0:03:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Gods in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.82,0:03:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, forgive them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.96,0:03:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Grant them peace and death.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.76,0:03:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Peace, yes, but not death.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.88,0:03:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, it's not all bad, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.18,0:04:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I did find the real Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.66,0:04:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you there wasn't\Nany choice in the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.28,0:04:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you expect?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.38,0:04:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark King Rayleigh was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.16,0:04:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He's as strong as Kizalu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.92,0:04:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Even with the pacifistas, we\Ncouldn't so much as slow him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.98,0:04:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, the Caribou Brothers\Nescaped along with the rest of their crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.90,0:04:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems they took some of the\Nfake Straw Hats with them as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.12,0:04:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,though I can't imagine why.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.88,0:04:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,At any rate, we captured\Nmost of the pirates,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.36,0:04:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,even though the real Straw Hats\Nheavily damaged two of our pacifistas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.94,0:04:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,One of the units was the same\Nprototype they fought before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.56,0:04:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Its strength hasn't changed in the\Nlast two years. That's bad news for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.92,0:04:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what they've\Nbeen up to but the straw
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.72,0:04:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,hats are immeasurably more\Ndangerous than before!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.24,0:04:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell the Marines in the new world that\Nthey have a new threat coming their way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.66,0:04:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats have returned and they're\Nstronger than we could have imagined!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.32,0:05:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,A pity they had
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.90,0:05:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,to take off so
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.81,0:05:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon, but but I'm proud\Nof them. They're tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.90,0:05:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gonna do just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.96,0:05:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You were watching?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.36,0:05:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm a big fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.70,0:05:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that smile, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.82,0:05:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What's on your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.62,0:05:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.44,0:05:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing, Rayleigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.64,0:05:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's a nice ship you got there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.62,0:05:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, but it's not exactly mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.48,0:05:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather, I stole it after\Nmy house burned down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.12,0:05:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.03,0:05:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.26,0:05:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Rayleigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.50,0:05:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,My name's Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.84,0:05:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's destiny meeting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.26,0:05:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I say, how about we team up and\Nturn this whole world upside down?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.70,0:05:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.61,0:05:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And I thought I drank too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.46,0:05:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know who you are or what\Nyou're selling, but I'm not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.42,0:05:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Before then, I never\Nbelieved much in fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.42,0:05:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But maybe nothing really\Nhappens by accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.66,0:06:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We're just too blind to see all the signs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.80,0:06:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, that hat found the right man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.62,0:06:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So long as it sails,\NI'll stay here, waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.50,0:06:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I want to see a\Nnew king before I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.54,0:06:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The surface is already\Nso far away. What a view!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.84,0:06:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been under before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.20,0:06:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The portholes on a submarine?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.74,0:06:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They got nothing on this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.06,0:06:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We're sinking! Sinking!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.04,0:06:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What if we get a leak?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.24,0:06:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This is freaking me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.94,0:06:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it feels like we're\Nleaving the whole world behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.52,0:06:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's eerie. No big deal. I've done this\Nlike a bajillion times before. It's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.82,0:06:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The ocean sure is\Nawesome look at that they
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.70,0:06:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,really are trees
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.61,0:06:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,they're giant mangroves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.06,0:06:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't tell when you're up top but\Nit's sure quite a sight to see from down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.08,0:06:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Here the majesty of nature\Nis truly humbling who
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.64,0:07:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Cares I've seen this, cuz you\Ngot on the wrong ship! Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.12,0:07:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ruin this for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.06,0:07:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,These roots, they're beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.52,0:07:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.16,0:07:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,They stretch all the way down\Nto the bottom of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.50,0:07:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, you win.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.18,0:07:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper, I think there's\Nsomething behind that tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.44,0:07:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.54,0:07:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.66,0:07:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It took us long enough to get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.50,0:07:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But whatever, it was worth the wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.54,0:07:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what comes next.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.14,0:07:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, fishies!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.04,0:07:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And then I can grab them!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.48,0:07:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.66,0:07:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,These look pretty good, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.10,0:07:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.38,0:07:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.24,0:07:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If you put that bubble in we'll\Ndie, I'm gonna kill you! Twice!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.50,0:07:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami, you know how the\Ncoding works, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.68,0:07:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we get some basic tips before\Nanother idiot flips out on us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.96,0:07:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Good point. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.68,0:08:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Rayleigh gave me a manual,\Nbut I can summarize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.50,0:08:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So, listen closely, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.46,0:08:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's real!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.70,0:08:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I could die happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.04,0:08:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Saatchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.06,0:08:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to take us with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.40,0:08:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, slip it out now, idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.58,0:08:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.49,0:08:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,His nosebleed shot him out! Saatchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.30,0:08:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of the ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.48,0:08:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Bright sea water! Dammit! Keep pulling!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.90,0:08:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji, what the heck\Nhappened to you back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.44,0:08:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you were weak to pretty\Ngirls, but this is a real liability.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.10,0:08:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to be cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.84,0:08:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That poor man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.28,0:08:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I can only imagine the horrors he must\Nhave endured during the past two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.58,0:08:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hope he lives long enough to see\Nthe mermaids he was so looking forward to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.60,0:08:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And let's also hope they aren't quite so
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.16,0:08:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,lovely that the sight of\Nthem strikes him dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.20,0:08:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,When we get there, we'll have\Nto ask for blood donations.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.82,0:08:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But they won't be human.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.90,0:08:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.81,0:09:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Sunny's coding has the same\Nproperties as the bubbles on Sabaody.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.28,0:09:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,meaning that objects or people can pass in
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.46,0:09:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,and out without causing\Nit any harm at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.86,0:09:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Spare me the bubble science!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.34,0:09:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We got a man down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.08,0:09:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji aside, she's not wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.02,0:09:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We saw this all over Sabaody.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.42,0:09:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It only stretches so far, then\Nallows an object to pass through.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.90,0:09:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So the good news is, if\Nwe get attacked by any
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.46,0:09:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,nasty sea creatures we\Ncan still fire cannons
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.94,0:09:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,at them just like we\Nwould if we were above
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.86,0:09:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,water wait so what would pop it is it that
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.46,0:09:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,durable it does fine\Nwith single objects but
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.10,0:09:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,if too many things pass\Nthrough at once then
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.94,0:09:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,it'll break let's see like if the sea king
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.72,0:09:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,clamps down on the ship\Nfor example that's bad
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.48,0:09:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Also the coating doesn't\Nprotect the ship from
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.78,0:09:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,anything except water so\Nif we crash into a rock
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.28,0:09:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,or a trench and the\Nmass breaks or something
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.24,0:09:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,like that then the bubble\Ncould also burst so it's
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.78,0:09:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,not like we can just\Nbounce around down here
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.54,0:10:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,still as long as we take\Nthe usual precautions we
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.44,0:10:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,should be fine i mean i'm\Nsure luffy will try to
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.74,0:10:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,get us all killed but what\Nelse is new so we're in
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.22,0:10:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,the clear after all good\Nwell in theory at least
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.12,0:10:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,but a lot of ships try\Nto make the trip to fish
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.08,0:10:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Man island and over 70\Npercent of them sink. We
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.16,0:10:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Are so dead, one Gum-Gum\Ngatling and I bet I can
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.82,0:10:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,catch all the fish swimming\Nout there yeah if i
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.70,0:10:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,couldn't have holes in\Nthis bubble thing i bet i
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.46,0:10:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,could catch even more\Nweren't you listening to
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.20,0:10:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,nami that's too many holes\Nour chances down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.38,0:10:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,are bad enough as it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.76,0:10:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, break your bones!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.76,0:10:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fix them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.67,0:10:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's break them again! No fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.74,0:10:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Haji said he'd show us the Fishman Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.74,0:10:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Like it was no big deal, And now\Nwe're stuck in this death bubble!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.72,0:10:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,slowly descending to our demise! Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.06,0:10:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Lunchtime!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.97,0:10:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,They packed a bunch of food for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.80,0:10:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Since Sanji's sick, we should\Nhave ourselves a Pikmin!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.96,0:10:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.87,0:10:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,All that screaming made me hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.38,0:11:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm wasting away! Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.60,0:11:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have to stir it or\Nanything right now, do we?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.58,0:11:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.49,0:11:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll just be cruising on the sea\Ncurrent till we get further down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.66,0:11:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's something you guys should\Nprobably know before we reach Fishman Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.72,0:11:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's robot stuff, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.88,0:11:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, no new secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.52,0:11:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Secrets inaccessible. Robo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.32,0:11:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He speaks robot!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.02,0:11:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Like Usopp said,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.78,0:11:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hachi was supposed to show us the\Nway to Fishman Island himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.70,0:11:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,but he got hurt real bad back on Sabo Odi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.56,0:11:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He came down here ahead of\Nus to get medical treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.84,0:11:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, it was the same\Nthing that happened to Devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.68,0:11:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Meaning, he was protecting the\NSunny from anyone who came for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.28,0:11:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Things got ugly about a year ago when the\NNavy found out the ship was docked there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.42,0:11:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Both him and Devil got\Ntaken out in a big fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.60,0:11:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.51,0:11:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, a year?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.68,0:11:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Then who was protecting\Nthe Sunny after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.18,0:11:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We had one more secret ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.92,0:12:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone who separated us two\Nyears ago, for better or worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.84,0:12:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The Warlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.28,0:12:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Turns out Bartholomew Kuma was\Non our side the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.56,0:12:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,A few days back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.14,0:12:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,When I made it to the Sunny,\NI couldn't believe my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.24,0:12:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He was right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.12,0:12:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.42,0:12:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.08,0:12:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Mission accomplished.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.02,0:12:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.08,0:12:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,There wasn't a single\Nscratch on the Sunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.74,0:12:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Later, Rayleigh gave me the whole story.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.52,0:12:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a member of the Revolutionary Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.48,0:12:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's within my power, I want to\Nhelp the Straw Hats escape from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.26,0:12:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys probably knew that something\Nwas up, but now we know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.24,0:12:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He saved the Sunny,\Nand he saved our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.50,0:12:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, after we were\Nsent flying from the island,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.12,0:12:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuma paid Rayleigh a visit\Nand dropped another bombshell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.58,0:13:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.94,0:13:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Not as myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.56,0:13:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The details are a little\Nsketchy, but evidently,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.62,0:13:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuma surrendered his body to the Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.12,0:13:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,They used him as an experiment and\Nreplaced his body parts one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.40,0:13:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,By the time the War of\Nthe Best rolled around,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.70,0:13:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,his personality had been\Ncompletely erased. Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.00,0:13:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He knew where he sent us, but he didn't\Nknow what we'd do once we got there,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.30,0:13:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,or that we would even make it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.10,0:13:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And you said his personality was taken\Naway, but he still protected the Sunny?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.40,0:13:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy who worked on him is\Nthis dude named Dr. Vegapunk,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.02,0:13:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,and Kuma must have made\Na deal with him because
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.34,0:13:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,he programmed one final\Nmission into his brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.02,0:13:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Defend the Thousand Sunny\Nfrom any attackers until
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.26,0:13:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,the moment that a straw\Nhat returns to claim it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.30,0:13:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So even though he's been reduced\Nto a living weapon with no memory,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.30,0:13:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,he's been carrying out his own orders,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.62,0:13:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,protecting our ship for the past\Ntwo years to fulfill his last wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.36,0:13:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.44,0:13:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He barely knew us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.82,0:14:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, why'd it matter\Nto him? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.22,0:14:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's because of Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.72,0:14:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You said Kuma was part of\Nthe Revolutionary Army,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.12,0:14:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and Luffy's dad is the\Nleader of those guys, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.66,0:14:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know much about my dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.64,0:14:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,but it seems like that robot\Nbear dude was a good guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.42,0:14:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,so he can't be too bad if they're friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.00,0:14:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.98,0:14:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The bottom line is,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.74,0:14:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,our survival and all the things we\Naccomplished in the past two years,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.48,0:14:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,we owe to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.70,0:14:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever his reason was,\Nwe should be grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.68,0:14:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And we may never find out the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.76,0:14:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,because it's not like we can ask\Nhim to explain himself anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.00,0:14:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,All we can do now is\Nhonor his memory and know
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.40,0:14:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,that Bartholomew Kuma\Nwas our greatest ally,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.30,0:14:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,until he took his last breath as a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.52,0:14:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, we'll never be able to\Nthank him since he'll just be a weapon,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.92,0:14:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,and likely our enemy\Nthe next time we meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.36,0:14:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all I wanted to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.04,0:14:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Kind of a lot to work through\Nall at once, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.18,0:14:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Someday, I hope we can at least\Nfind out the rest of the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.86,0:14:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're awake. Good. Have some lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.66,0:14:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's from Amazon Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.44,0:15:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Amazon Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.02,0:15:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The island with all the women.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.48,0:15:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course that's where he sent you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.08,0:15:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know where I was\Nthese past two years?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.12,0:15:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm kind of thinking Kuma's\Nnot such a good friend after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.34,0:15:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, if he were here right now,\NI'd like to kick his metal face in!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.40,0:15:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, now, Sanji, we've all\Nhad our share of troubles.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.10,0:15:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Before I became a pop music\Nsensation, I was trapped in a cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.18,0:15:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, the only thing that matters\Nnow is the voyage awaiting us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.42,0:15:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Straight ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.33,0:15:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, look! It's them! I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.24,0:15:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Like you said, they're straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.34,0:15:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm blind?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.70,0:15:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we'll be sailing\Nwith the Straw Hats after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.18,0:15:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, how far down are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.66,0:15:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but it's\Ngetting darker and darker.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.60,0:15:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We passed the photic zone,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.42,0:15:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,and it looks like we're around\Nthe bottom of the a-photic zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.76,0:15:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,About a thousand meters, give or take.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.18,0:15:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Quiet and the sunny\Nitself feels oddly still.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.52,0:15:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost like floating in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.36,0:15:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look it's a whale.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.44,0:15:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just like the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.52,0:16:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah it looks more like white beard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.86,0:16:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec what is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.00,0:16:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,A fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.91,0:16:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No are you ready we only\Nget one shot at this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.28,0:16:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready brother ready captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.96,0:16:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Before you say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.38,0:16:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.00,0:16:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Just shoot them and they'll all drown.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.40,0:16:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,They're wanted dead or alive after\Nall, so why not let them die?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.54,0:16:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that wouldn't do it all, because\Nthe Navy wouldn't know who killed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.18,0:16:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to deliver their heads\Npersonally on a silver platter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.72,0:16:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Then they will fear us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.40,0:16:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole world will do our strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.24,0:16:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll take them out before\Nthey suspect a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.06,0:16:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My big smiling face is the last\Nthing they'll see before they die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.36,0:16:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys! There's a ship-looking\Nthing coming our way, what you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.78,0:16:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you come look for yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.72,0:17:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a pirate ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.54,0:17:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They're ramming straight into us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.34,0:17:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away you morons!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.80,0:17:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna make us all drown!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.02,0:17:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not trying to break our\Nship, they're trying to board it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.90,0:17:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Tumit? Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.30,0:17:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it up, Seacow! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.24,0:17:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You think they want to board the ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.60,0:17:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Seacow?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.48,0:17:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that noise from somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.88,0:17:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.14,0:17:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Is everybody ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.34,0:17:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.50,0:17:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.74,0:17:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We've met before!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.80,0:17:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're from the Arlong Pirates, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.38,0:17:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.29,0:17:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I was at Arlong Park!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.32,0:17:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy, doesn't that\Nthing look kind of familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.88,0:17:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.50,0:17:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, go, pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.72,0:17:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's pay our new friends\Na visit, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.80,0:18:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's stay out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.88,0:18:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time to waste!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.80,0:18:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow my lead!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.50,0:18:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.46,0:18:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They're completely dumbfounded!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.28,0:18:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If they're gonna sit there catching flies,\Nthen we'll strike while the iron is hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.58,0:18:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll smite this entire crew, right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.56,0:18:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Come along, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.42,0:18:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll make the beggars for mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.94,0:18:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Skull? Don't panic!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.40,0:18:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.08,0:18:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We have Captain Carable\Non the ship back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.26,0:18:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.42,0:18:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, it's time for a little greeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.56,0:18:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire the Gatling gun, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.72,0:18:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Shower them in bullets!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.38,0:18:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I want every last one of them dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.28,0:18:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Send these Straw Hats to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.88,0:19:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.86,0:19:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not going to throw\Nme into the water, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.02,0:19:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't do that to me, my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.58,0:19:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.62,0:19:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, you're very good-looking!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.06,0:19:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure someone like you understands\Nthe value of human life, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.38,0:19:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Emphasize!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.29,0:19:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The gods are watching!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.74,0:19:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be judged for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.90,0:19:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, make up your freaking mind already!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.42,0:19:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Weren't you just about to fire your Gatling\Ngun and blast to saw the kingdom come?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.20,0:19:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, tell me, I know you're the captain\Nof that ship, but what's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.36,0:19:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Roro no Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.48,0:19:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.70,0:19:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the world makes you\Nthink I would be the captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.52,0:19:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm... Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.08,0:19:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Those ruffians were keeping me as a...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.84,0:19:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,a slave! That's it! Boy! Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.16,0:19:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad that's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.38,0:19:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, how's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.80,0:19:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I could stay on this nice\Nship with you all for a little while?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.38,0:19:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Please? Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.64,0:19:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel kind of sorry for this poor loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.20,0:19:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,HE'S OBVIOUSLY LYING!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.74,0:20:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,ARE YOU CRAZY?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.76,0:20:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,WHAT?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.84,0:20:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,SERIOUSLY?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.18,0:20:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I have a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.74,0:20:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd that giant sea cow\Npulling your ship come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.66,0:20:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.74,0:20:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.90,0:20:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's this vixen?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.00,0:20:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I take it you're the famous cat burglar.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.80,0:20:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch it, pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.86,0:20:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody's allowed to drool over our\Nbeautiful navigator except for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.82,0:20:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.32,0:20:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're perfectly s -
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.86,0:20:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's getting really old!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.86,0:20:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.02,0:20:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea cow? Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.02,0:20:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I just happened to catch it\Nout in the ocean somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.78,0:20:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,When you're underwater,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.34,0:20:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,having a sea monster pull your ship\Nis the mark of an experienced captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.48,0:20:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.06,0:20:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.00,0:20:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, sea cow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.22,0:20:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the problem? Oh, brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.68,0:20:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on our way to rescue you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.70,0:20:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna find a sea monster, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.04,0:20:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What crazy ideas are\Nyou hatching now, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.56,0:21:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We should try to rehabilitate him with\Nsomething a little less sexy. Hey, Nami,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.50,0:21:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,the direction we're taking isn't exactly\Nthe same way the Log Pose is pointing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.42,0:21:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.08,0:21:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The correct course is technically\Nsouthwest, so we're in the clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.02,0:21:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but if we went in a straight line,\Nwe could get there a whole lot faster,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.14,0:21:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,couldn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.05,0:21:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if you go straight, you risk\Ngetting swept away in a sea current.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.88,0:21:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And if that should happen, you might run\Ninto an underwater mountain or a volcano,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.18,0:21:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,see?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.09,0:21:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.46,0:21:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yikes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.37,0:21:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm with you on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.92,0:21:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I thought all the\Ncurrents here were dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.20,0:21:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It is the Grand Line, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.36,0:21:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So are you saying that some\Nof them are actually stable?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.28,0:21:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this one is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.92,0:21:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you stay put. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.80,0:21:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna start getting\Ncolder from here on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.18,0:21:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,so make sure you put\Non a coat or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.26,0:21:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You bring up a good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.38,0:21:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm already starting to\Nfeel goosebumps on my skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.14,0:21:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, except for I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.30,0:21:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have any skin\Nbecause you're a skeleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.88,0:22:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, skull jokes are\Nthe only thing I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.98,0:22:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't take that away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.38,0:22:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going somewhere\Ncold, not the deep sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.54,0:22:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you guys know the\Nwater's cold in the deep sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.26,0:22:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just like a bathtub.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.62,0:22:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hot water rises and cold\Nsinks to the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.08,0:22:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Aha,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.99,0:22:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,because heat rises and\Nthere's not much sunlight,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.08,0:22:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,so there's nothing to\Nheat the water down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.28,0:22:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The temperature's not the only thing\Nthat's different at the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.20,0:22:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not still depressed, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.52,0:22:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we move down, we'll find\Nsomething called deep currents.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.62,0:22:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't run into them terribly often,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.38,0:22:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,but they're much larger\Nthan the regular currents.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.26,0:22:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Also,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.17,0:22:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,they're quite unique in that\Ntheir flow is completely
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.04,0:22:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,independent of what you\Nsee closer to the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.66,0:22:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Currents under the currents and\Nyou even have a diagram, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.48,0:22:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure do know a lot of stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.62,0:22:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because I'm so old.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.32,0:22:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only that, but all currents\Nare connected to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.96,0:22:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't mean they have\Nto flow in the same direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.12,0:22:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They flow east, west, up and down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.42,0:23:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like a big long\Ndragon all tangled up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.64,0:23:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The deep currents tend to travel\Nat a surprisingly slow pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.10,0:23:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,After they reach the deep sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.66,0:23:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,it takes approximately\N2,000 years before they
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.22,0:23:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,finally make their way up\Nto the surface of the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.90,0:23:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes me feel young again, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.56,0:23:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,2,000?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.38,0:23:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, 2,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.72,0:23:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And because of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.08,0:23:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,there are countless tales about what\Nlurks within those deep, dark currents.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.48,0:23:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Monsters. Curses.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.80,0:23:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The Wrath of the Undead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.24,0:23:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean the deep sea is haunted? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.02,0:23:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is haunted? Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.90,0:23:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds fun to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.42,0:23:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.90,0:23:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know anything about\Nthe Wrath of the Undead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.48,0:23:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,or whatever you're freaking out about,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.46,0:23:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,but I do know that we'll encounter\Na downward-flowing current soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.28,0:23:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we do, we should be able to\Nride it down into the deep sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.60,0:23:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,She said something about deep\Nsea currents, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.10,0:23:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You morons can at least\Npretend like you understand me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.74,0:23:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami, I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.66,0:24:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.94,0:24:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.42,0:24:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.56,0:24:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This one's called the downward plume.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.06,0:24:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost like a giant waterfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.60,0:24:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Except underwater!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.46,0:24:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's going so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.60,0:24:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is like falling into the sea,\Nwhich doesn't make sense, but I like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.80,0:24:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother Nature, you're one crazy lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.38,0:24:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What a spectacular sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.24,0:24:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And from the looks of it, I'd\Nsay the stream runs barely deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.42,0:24:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard stories about these currents,\Nbut they did not do them justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.90,0:24:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's crazy dark down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.64,0:24:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The floor so far, you can't even see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.06,0:24:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.42,0:24:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,At this speed, we're gonna get\Npile-driven straight down to the bottom!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.76,0:24:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure it's safe if we\Njust go with the flow?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.12,0:24:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're worried about\Nthe ship, don't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.46,0:25:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sunny was built from\Nthe treasure tree, Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.06,0:25:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's as tough as they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.36,0:25:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.80,0:25:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.66,0:25:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.88,0:25:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.94,0:25:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So it really does live down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.02,0:25:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.62,0:25:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Please listen to me, Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.94,0:25:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to turn back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.04,0:25:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna die. Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.44,0:25:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot you were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.50,0:25:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a sea monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.14,0:25:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Kraken.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.88,0:25:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A legendary giant octopus monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.86,0:25:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He made fish food out of those ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.24,0:25:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They left for the new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.96,0:25:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And never made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.54,0:25:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn around, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.30,0:25:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not ready to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.66,0:25:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.90,0:25:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait around for a couple days.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.28,0:25:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And it'll probably go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.00,0:25:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up for a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.50,0:26:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I just had a perfect idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.46,0:26:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.37,0:26:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We just have to capture it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.78,0:26:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.48,0:26:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you lost your mind, Loopy?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.98,0:26:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If we catch it, we can teach\Nit how to pull the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.96,0:26:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Like hell we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.00,0:26:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I tell you, look at it. But\Nit's so ridiculously huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.14,0:26:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how in the world\Nyou can miss a damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.26,0:26:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I gotta get it, babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.70,0:26:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.34,0:26:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It must have been here for centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.72,0:26:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The Kraken shows have been\Nmissed from all over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.52,0:26:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's one of the most terrible\Nmonsters that ever lived.
